venture capitalists, and strategic partners\n* ​Energy, chip, and data center operators\n* ​Policy and ecosystem leaders\n\n***\n\n## ​**Event Details**\n\n​**Date:** Wednesday, December 9th, 2026\n**Location:** San Francisco\n**Time:** 8:30 a.m.–8:00 p.m. PT\n**Host:** IgniteGTM\n\nIf you would like to have a demo / marketing table, please send an email message to:\n\nsiliconvalleysponsor@gmail.com\n\nPut this in the subject header:\n\nW 12/9/26 - Tabler","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/silicon-valley-machine-learning-learners-and-entrepreneurs/events/317557255/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":0,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":null,"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:459993399"},"feeSettings":null,"group":{"__ref":"Group:19165930"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":2,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:11354511"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:357553399"}}}]},"series":null,"venue":{"__typename":"Venue","name":"The Midway","address":"900 Marin St, San Francisco, CA 94124, USA","city":"San Francisco","state":"CA","country":"us"}}},"_sentryTraceData":"e0c65cb79fe65034be00c582ee97d79e-bd10003ff54a3f01-0","_sentryBaggage":"sentry-environment=production,sentry-release=ccd1aebcde5d2dfdbf081f86deedb26c82a71fdb,sentry-public_key=5d12cd2317664353456ab4c40d079af2,sentry-trace_id=e0c65cb79fe65034be00c582ee97d79e,sentry-org_id=6787,sentry-sampled=false,sentry-sample_rand=0.6759643543569323,sentry-sample_rate=0.01"},"__N_SSP":true},"page":"/find","query":{"keywords":"ai","location":"us--ca--San Francisco","source":"EVENTS"},"buildId":"ccd1aebcde5d2dfdbf081f86deedb26c82a71fdb","isFallback":false,"isExperimentalCompile":false,"gssp":true,"locale":"en-US","locales":["en-US","en-AU","de","de-DE","es","es-ES","fr","fr-FR","it","it-IT","ja","ja-JP","ko","ko